10;&#10;if p&lt;r do&#10;&#10;q = ⌊(p+r)/2⌋&#10;&#10;spawn Parallel-Merge-Sort(A, p, q)&#10;&#10;spawn Parallel-Merge-Sort(A, q+1, r)&#10;&#10;sync&#10;&#10;Merge(A, p, q, r) end&#10;&#10;Her er Merge den serielle procedure til at flette to sorterede lister beskrevet i CLRS kapitel 2.&#10;Betragt nu et kald Parallel-Merge-Sort(A, 1, n) på et array af længde n.&#10;Hvad er arbejde (eng. work) og spand (eng. span) for dette kald?&#10;&#10;Der er præcis ét korrekt svar, men du må vælge flere.\" width=\"616\" height=\"290\"/>\n    </div>","title":"Arbejde og spand","type":"mcq","ui_style":{"type":"horizontal"},"validation":{"allow_negative_scores":true,"scoring_type":"exactMatch","valid_response":{"score":1,"value":["5"]}}},"metadata":null}],"features":[],"tags":[],"labels":[{"id":10528,"name":"9/30/2026_11:29:38AM","type":"personal"}]},{"reference":"3974290f-f276-4e49-b05e-0bcc77f9c35a","title":"Disjunkte mængder","description":"","stimulus":" ","workflow":[],"metadata":[],"note":"","source":"","definition":{"widgets":[{"reference":"85ea8861-9123-4f3c-adde-52aa774e2aa7"}]},"status":"published","questions":[{"type":"mcq","widget_type":"response","reference":"85ea8861-9123-4f3c-adde-52aa774e2aa7","data":{"minScore":0,"multiple_responses":true,"options":[{"label":"\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqti_v2p1\">\n          <img src=\"https://api.stage.eu.wiseflow.io/link-signer/v1/static/wf-eu-central-1-stage-author-assets/images/59596441-6a5b-418d-8fd5-53381f9f3d7c\" alt=\"Tiden er O(n)\" width=\"616\" height=\"27\"/>\n        </div>\n      ","value":"0"},{"label":"\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqti_v2p1\">\n          <img src=\"https://api.stage.eu.wiseflow.io/link-signer/v1/static/wf-eu-central-1-stage-author-assets/images/6fad549b-8b40-4296-8b4d-9aa57f419117\" alt=\"Tiden er O(n log n)\" width=\"616\" height=\"27\"/>\n        </div>\n      ","value":"1"},{"label":"\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqti_v2p1